# The extrusion of path_extrude hollowed, open at the top face picked
# with the mouse; the same as path_shell.go makes
# (TestPathEquivalence/shell).
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
move 290 265
down L 290 265
up L 290 265
menu Features|Shell Solid
